@startuml
' Wrong on purpose: the door is locked when the guest comes back for the
' keys, and its machine has no way to open it there. `omaspec play keys.puml
' --lockstep -o keys.gif` shows where.
title Back for the keys
actor Guest
participant Door
participant Alarm
Guest -> Door : close
Guest -> Door : lock
Guest -> Alarm : arm
== the keys are still inside ==
Guest -> Door : open
@enduml
